# 13. RUN FIRESTORE RULE TESTS

Now that Java/emulators are available, this is mandatory.

Automate tests proving:

```text
anonymous denied

User A can access A's data

User A cannot access B's data

User B cannot access A's data

owner permissions work

editor permissions work if sharing exists

viewer permissions work if sharing exists

invalid writes are rejected
```

A security-rule test failure is a release blocker.

